PAL16L8
DOP2E
Dopple Board Arbitration PAL 8/16 bit
Scott Statton, Developer Resources,Mtn. View, CA

ROM TWE0 TWE1 NMIIN CLEAR STAT PIN7 PIN8 PIN9 GND
PIN11 NMIOUT PIN13 Q P D0 WPV PIN18 PIN19 VCC

IF (/STAT)
	/D0 = /Q

/Q = P * WPV

/P = Q * CLEAR

/NMIOUT = /NMIIN + /WPV

/WPV = /ROM * /TWE1 + /ROM * /TWE0

FUNCTION TABLE

ROM TWE0 TWE1 NMIIN CLEAR STAT WPV NMIOUT Q P D0

; R  T  T  N  C  S | W  N  Q  P  D
; O  W  W  M  L  T | P  M        0
; M  0  1  I  R  A | V  I
------------------------------------
