  H  H  H  H  H  H   H  H  H  L  Z
  H  H  H  H  H  L   H  H  H  L  H
  L  H  H  H  H  H   H  H  H  L  Z
  L  L  H  H  H  H   L  X  X  X  Z
  L  L  H  H  H  H   L  L  X  X  Z
  H  H  H  H  H  H   H  H  L  H  Z
  H  H  H  H  H  L   H  H  L  H  L
